      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785329545856,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "There are two big problems here\n 1. There is no is-a relationship between Pragrammer and LapTop \nas we know that inheritance must be used where there is \nis-a relationship.\n\n2. Programmer inherits LapTop ,and we know that java doesn't allowed \nmultiple inheritance , thus Programmer can't inherit another class.\nLike Human class.\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "There are two big problems here\n 1. There is no is-a relationship between Pragrammer and LapTop \nas we know that inheritance must be used where there is \nis-a relationship.\n\n2. Programmer inherits LapTop ,and we know that java doesn't allowed \nmultiple inheritance , thus Programmer can't inherit another class.\nLike Human class.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
