      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785330629395,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "In has a realtionship we make Object of one class into another \nand access their methods.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "In has a realtionship we make Object of one class into another \nand access their methods.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "FmowGlI2t37Ndak0wlG6p",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 289.4075503160264,
      "y": 1954.8316285107894,
      "width": 723,
      "height": 250,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aB",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 931673515,
      "version": 408,
      "versionNonce": 280955947,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785331831892,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "But still there are three problems here :\n\n1. Tight Coupling\n\n ->   Here programmer and Laptop are tightly coupled.\nThus any change in LapTop will also affect Programmer.\n\n2. Programmer need to  make objects by there own.\n\n3. For Every Object of Programmer there will be same output. ($3DIEX-3)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "But still there are three problems here :\n\n1. Tight Coupling\n\n ->   Here programmer and Laptop are tightly coupled.\nThus any change in LapTop will also affect Programmer.\n\n2. Programmer need to  make objects by there own.\n\n3. For Every Object of Programmer there will be same output. ($3DIEX-3)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
